            "name": "Create webhook",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a webhook subscription. Everhour sends a verification POST with an X-Hook-Secret header to the target URL; the target must echo the header back to complete verification. Supported events cover project, task, timer, time, section, client, and estimate changes.",
